PARITY (web TeslaChargingSessionsMap.tsx -> native), no scope narrowing
==================================================================================
  - center memo (avg s.latitude??0 / s.longitude??0, default {37.77,-122.42} when empty)
    -> TeslaChargingSessionsMapProjection.centerCoordinate — ported verbatim + tested.
  - clusterPoints filter (typeof lat/lng === 'number' && !isNaN) -> Marker.from / isPlottable;
    NaN + nil excluded, real 0 retained — web-exact, tested (markers map(\.id) == [1,4]).
  - popupHtml -> TeslaChargingSessionCalloutDisplay: siteName (|| 'Unknown', empty-string falsy),
    formatDateTime(start), `${fmtNumber(convertEnergyFromSI(wh,'kWh'),1)} kWh` (energy only when
    total_energy_added_wh != null), formatCurrency(cost,2) (cost only when total_cost != null),
    charger_type UPPERCASE (only when a non-blank string) — every branch ported + tested.
    NB: web escapeHtml() is a DOM-only XSS concern; SwiftUI Text is inherently safe, so it is
    correctly NOT ported (platform adaptation, not scope narrowing).
  - ariaLabel t('tesla_sessions.markerLabel','{{name}} charging session',{name}) ->
    markerAccessibilityLabel on every annotation — tested.
  - wrapper role="application" aria-label t('tesla_sessions.mapLabel','Charging sessions map')
    -> the map container .accessibilityLabel + .accessibilityElement(children:.contain).
  - Leaflet MapContainer(zoom 5)+MapTileLayer+MarkerCluster(#22d3ee, radius 60) -> MapKit Map +
    brand-accent bolt pins + plotted-count chip; camera frames all markers via the shared,
    unit-tested TSGeo.boundingRegion (P4 core Components/Maps), falling back to the web center at
    a zoom-5-equivalent continental span when no marker has a usable coordinate.
  - All 3 web i18n keys reproduced verbatim in the catalog (tesla_sessions.unknown / .markerLabel
    / .mapLabel) + the popup energy template + native-chrome keys. No English literal in code.
  - States: loading (skeleton), loaded (map), empty (friendly — no rows OR none located), error
    (QueryError+retry), stale (chip+refresh), offline (cached+chip) — all rendered, never blank.
  - A11y: each marker = labelled Button (markerLabel); callout = one combined element (summary);
    count chip labelled; decorative glyphs accessibilityHidden; Reduce-Motion honored (skeleton/
    animations via TSAnimation/TSSkeleton).
  - Telemetry: TeslaChargingSessionsMapSurface.slug="TeslaChargingSessionsMap" emitted via P1/S11
    view.opened on appear (idempotent), os_log default sink, redaction-safe (no VIN/coords/cost).

